# ==============================================================================
# Documented Architecture & Security Exceptions for Trivy IaC Scanner
# ==============================================================================

# Outbound HTTPS (443 / all egress) is required by ECS tasks to connect to
# Slack Socket Mode (wss://wss-primary.slack.com) and opt-in GitLab/GitHub/Datadog APIs.
AVD-AWS-0104

# AWS Managed SSE (AES256 / SQS-SSE / DynamoDB default KMS) is used by default
# instead of customer-managed KMS keys (CMK) to avoid $1/mo/key fixed FinOps overhead.
AVD-AWS-0023
AVD-AWS-0024
AVD-AWS-0025
AVD-AWS-0033
AVD-AWS-0065
AVD-AWS-0088
AVD-AWS-0089
AVD-AWS-0090
AVD-AWS-0093
AVD-AWS-0094
AVD-AWS-0132
AVD-AWS-0135
AVD-AWS-0136

# CloudWatch Describe*, Logs Describe*/FilterLogEvents, and SES Get*/PutSuppressedDestination
# require Resource = "*" in AWS IAM as those APIs do not support resource-level ARN scoping.
AVD-AWS-0057

# CloudFront and S3 access logging buckets are optional to keep the Core Hub at $0.00/hr idle cost.
AVD-AWS-0010
AVD-AWS-0011
AVD-AWS-0071
AVD-AWS-0086
AVD-AWS-0087
AVD-AWS-0091

# VPC Flow Logs are optional in default self-contained mode to avoid extra CloudWatch Logs ingestion costs.
AVD-AWS-0178
